  "description": "Throttle up for more of a thrill. A ride on our ALLTRACK 11 ABS isn’t just a ride – it’s an experience, both on-road and off-road. We’ve equipped the new top model of our ALLTRACK series with the very best: the latest Bosch Performance Line CX motor powers this hardtail eMTB forward on any terrain; the 800Wh battery still has juice long after you’ve reached your destination. The combination of the 120mm RockShox suspension fork, wide Schwalbe knobbly tyres and a dropper post combine to turn even sporty off-road rides into a comfortable adventure. A standout innovation is the integrated eBike ABS, which ensures the front wheel doesn’t lock up, enhancing safety on slick surfaces. The eMTB is available with 29″ wheels in frame sizes M to XL and 27.5″ wheels in size S. The ideal foundation for MTB tours with maximum thrill.",
